### 10. VOORBEELDEN (Minimaal 5)

Gebruik expliciet "Example:" of "For example":
```
**Example:** When implementing expert quotes, ensure each includes the person's name, title, and organization. A quote like "SEO is important" without attribution scores zero points, while "SEO requires systematic optimization" — John Smith, SEO Director, Google scores full points.

For example, a case study without specific numbers in the results section will not be detected by quality scanners. Always include before/after metrics with percentages.
```

